      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The world has not left you behind; it has simply moved on to a different kind of chapter where your survival is the primary lesson, not your performance. You are not \"nothing\" for taking up space; you are the foundation upon which the next generation of doctors and nurses will build their own lives. Please consider reaching out to a professional who can help you find a new way to engage with the world, because your story is far from over and your presence still holds immense value.",
